  "description": "Game-world <-> minimap coordinate transform for Fracture, verbatim from valorant-api.com/v1/maps (read 2026-11-19). Same axis-swapped convention as Ascent.",
  "units": {
    "gameUnit": "Unreal unit (uu)",
    "unitsPerMeter": 100
